# Example output written to the repo root by examples/lug_drawing.py,
# examples/lifting_lug_calc_report.py and examples/feature_control_frame_drawing.py. These
# are regenerable artifacts, not sources — tracked copies dirtied the working tree on every
# run of the examples, and the diffs are timestamps and GUIDs. The root-file gate in
# tests/test_contract.py is what keeps the fourth one from landing.
